ranked_experiments.implementation:
1. Format 15,199 sessions x 8 turns = ~120k (conversation_text, track_metadata_text) pairs. conversation_text = 'User: {t1}
Assistant: {rec1}
...
User: {current}'. track_text = '{title} by {artist} from {album} {tags} {year}' (NO lyrics per TalkPlay ablation). 2. Load BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5 (110M params, 768d) via sentence-transformers. 3. Train with MultipleNegativesRankingLoss, batch_size=256, lr=2e-5, bf16, 2-3 epochs (~20 min on A100). 4. Hard negative mining stage 2: encode 47k tracks, mine top-50 non-gold neighbors, retrain 1 epoch at lr=1e-5 (~15 min). 5. Encode all 47k tracks (2-3 min). 6. Inference: encode each conversation, cosine sim top-100. 7. Add as new leg in LightGBM pool alongside existing 8 legs.
